{"skill":{"slug":"feishu-docx-powerwrite","displayName":"Feishu Docx PowerWrite"},"version":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1770197180818,"changelog":"Initial release: Docx markdown writing workflow + templates + troubleshooting","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":2003,"sha256":"fe08f03d7461dbc4441dbe5ce26852780e7629c4967c2da1f98e1677401f1aa5","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/templates.md","size":572,"sha256":"2aabbddec9421e187553981c58338853d702f2a41b9096d46f77970aefa40277","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/troubleshooting.md","size":714,"sha256":"e7e6461fd40f0c7907058bb7ef089c84f2f1130c7f29f3c9b3d38aaff26ac939","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"scripts/setup.sh","size":638,"sha256":"5af834f71dfd5566c5b771fc44d2fd976a2d5f66bf25d725a7d4d765748f975c","contentType":"application/x-sh"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2025,"sha256":"85a1a73076c77d1fc539ec9ec6fb84bfbc268c495b11adc5a4b5ce66b652f0ab","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789032389876,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"f223f24a5ee28c634fdba584c381ed3370784dcc2ea613afa608ba75794c47e9","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/f223f24a5ee28c634fdba584c381ed3370784dcc2ea613afa608ba75794c47e9","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: feishu-docx-powerwrite\nVersion: 0.1.0\n\nThe skill bundle is benign. All files, including the `SKILL.md` instructions for the AI agent, are clearly aligned with the stated purpose of writing to Feishu Docx. The `SKILL.md` explicitly advises against hardcoding tokens and emphasizes using the user's own Feishu app credentials, indicating a focus on security. The `scripts/setup.sh` file contains only diagnostic commands (`openclaw skills check`) and instructions for the user to configure their own Feishu app credentials, with a clear warning not to copy others' tokens. There is no evidence of data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence, or harmful prompt injection attempts.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779161268549},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":30,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":2,"checkedAt":1789032389876},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a straightforward Feishu/Lark document-writing helper whose document mutation behavior is expected, disclosed, and limited to user-provided Feishu access.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Feishu app credentials and Docx/Drive scopes are sensitive, but they are proportionate to writing Feishu documents and the skill tells users to use their own credentials and not hardcode tokens or document links.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The setup script only checks OpenClaw skill/tool visibility and prints a credential setup checklist; it does not download code, install dependencies, alter configuration, or persist services.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The trigger description includes Feishu doc/docx links and broad document-writing phrases, so users should ensure the skill is only invoked when they actually want Feishu document output; the runtime instructions do not direct automatic writes from a link alone.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, privilege escalation, background workers, credential harvesting, or local auth/session/profile access were found; destructive replace mode is explicitly labeled and requires confirm: true.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is converting Markdown into formatted Feishu Docx content using feishu_docx_write_markdown, and the described append/replace capabilities directly match that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you intend to let your agent write to Feishu/Lark Docx documents using your own Feishu app permissions. Review document targets before append operations, and use replace mode only when you explicitly want the whole document overwritten.","findings":"[RA1] unexpected: This appears to be a false positive: the cited text is the skill title and description using the word \"Write,\" not an instruction to modify the skill's own files, configuration, or behavior.\n[SQP-1] expected: The broad triggers relate to the declared Feishu document-writing purpose. This is worth user awareness because the skill can append or replace external documents, but the artifact discloses those modes and requires confirmation for replace.\n[AIG SARIF] expected: The static scan reported no results and a 100 security score, which is consistent with the inspected artifacts showing no hijacking, remote execution, persistence, or embedded malicious code.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789032389876}}}}}